the copy of {fmt} 10.2.1 that spdlog bundles, both under the MIT License.
Their notices follow, from https://github.com/gabime/spdlog/blob/v1.14.1/LICENSE
and https://github.com/fmtlib/fmt/blob/10.2.1/LICENSE.

